{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>王自如表示：「我下次可能就是十字路口了吧，借微博喊話，不吵了和解了。如果你想吵架成為大V的話，輸贏並不重要，比如我。」</p>\n<p>公開資料顯示，2014年，時任Zealer創始人王自如與羅永浩就錘子手機評測問題進行了一場長達三個小時的直播辯論，引發全網廣泛關注，該事件也常被網友稱為科技圈的經典「名場面」。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1018/4a16ef391d86337.jpg\">\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1018/4a16ef391d86337.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T10:18:50.704450+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":2,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T10:14:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T04:38:43.268988+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T10:17:34.756897+00:00","content_hash":"6edcc012631d556e034181d5c8d96c874fafafe87c123af14d748d9533d71c20","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}